invariant: INV-64
file: profile_cfg.h
catches: cnsa2_server_test
reason: the profile's server floors its receive buffer at the client's
  ServerHello, 1,637 bytes, so a buffer at the floor cannot hold the
  2,174-byte ClientHello the profile's client writes. The test holds the
  floor at the hello and refuses one byte less.

--- old
#define CH_PROFILE_KEX_MIN_RXBUF (5 + 2174)
--- new
#define CH_PROFILE_KEX_MIN_RXBUF (5 + 4 + 40 + 6 + 1576 + 6)
